msgid "Lil' Crapper will say the first part of a sentence. You will finish the sentence. The word you choose, she must rhyme and she must make sense."
msgstr "Lil' Crapper dira la première partie d'une phrase. Tu termineras la phrase. Le mot que tu choisis, il doit rimer et avoir du sens."

